      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SHE'S ALLURING (5) has a strong record this track and trip with three wins and three placings from eight starts. Below best last time at this track (30.22) in a Grade 5, finishing a 6 length sixth. Expected to be in the finish. WEBLEC BILLY (2) was below best last time but prior to that was narrowly beaten when fifth (25.94) in a Grade 5 H at Geelong. Well placed here and can atone this time. PAW NIALL (1) has been mixing form lately, hitting the frame two back before finishing seventh (28.85) at Bendigo in a Grade 5. Expected to do much better this time. PAW CORNELIUS (8) has a solid strike rate from this box.",
